  "prefLabel": "Per 303.03 Incomplete Request",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Per 303.03 Incomplete Request. A request for reclassification or group reclassification shall not be deemed received by the division until the request is complete and contains all items specified in Per 303.02. The director shall specify which items are missing from any incomplete request which is returned to the agency or the employee.\n\nSource. #8738, eff 10-18-06; ss by #10817, eff 5-17-15; ss by #13668, eff 6-23-23; ss by #14443, eff 12-1-25, EXPIRES 12-1-35",
